# Examples show their definitions

A reader of an example can see where every name comes from. The example includes each type, mapper, and helper the sample uses.

Do not leave that definition outside the example. A type or mapper that lives only in the test file, above the extracted sample, is hidden.

```csharp
// ❌ BAD — the sample calls User and UserContactsMapper, and neither is in the example
```csharp SqliteCommandIntegrationTests.cs#ExecuteReaderMapsFlatContacts

// ✅ GOOD — User is in the example, and UserContactsMapper is in the test the example shows
```csharp SqliteCommandIntegrationTests.cs#User
```csharp SqliteCommandIntegrationTests.cs#ExecuteReaderMapsFlatContacts
```
